{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.Sym2GateFSTrichotomy"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.geometric_half_is_all_that_is_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.geometric_half_is_all_that_is_derived","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L151-L158","doc":"The geometric half stands on its own, with no `FSType` content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.amphichiral_holonomy_not_flavour_triple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.amphichiral_holonomy_not_flavour_triple","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L124-L140","doc":"**The route-E conclusion for an amphichiral knot.**  If the holonomy's\noccurring irreps are self-dual — which §2 delivers from amphichirality — then\nthe object it carries is not the three-dimensional flavour candidate.\n\nThe `hsd` hypothesis is the bridge from the geometric self-duality of §2 to the\nrepresentation-theoretic `FSType` of the companion.  It is stated rather than\nderived **on purpose**: the two self-dualities are different notions (one is\n`ρ̄ ≅ ρ`, the other is a Frobenius–Schur type), and collapsing them silently\nwould be exactly the ambient-vs-instance conflation this arc has been\ncorrecting.  A user of this theorem must supply the identification. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.selfDual_candidate_not_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.selfDual_candidate_not_three","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L110-L122","doc":"**The screen, restated for a route.**  A candidate all of whose occurring\nirreps are self-dual is not three-dimensional-and-passing — the contrapositive\nof `even_dimOf_of_selfDual`, which is what makes non-self-duality the single\ncheckable condition rather than one desideratum among several. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.selfDual_of_amphichiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.selfDual_of_amphichiral","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L92-L102","doc":"**An amphichiral knot has a self-dual holonomy.**  No hypothesis on `iso`\nbeyond the mirror fact is needed: substituting `mirror K = K` into\n`MirrorConjugate` is the whole proof. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.MirrorConjugate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.MirrorConjugate","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L83-L88","doc":"**The standard fact, carried explicitly.**  The dual (complex-conjugate)\nof a holonomy representation is the holonomy of the mirror manifold.  Stated\nas a hypothesis so the theorem names exactly what it borrows from geometry. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.Amphichiral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.Amphichiral","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/AmphichiralHolonomyIsSelfDual.lean#L80-L81","doc":"`K` is amphichiral: it is its own mirror. ","signatureChunk":0}]}